The [[Bunch of Coins]] is an item only obtainable by "smashing" the [[Piggybank]] using a [[Hammer]]. It has no effect other than selling for 5 {{icon/gold}}. Of course, in the long-term, the [[Piggybank]] could possibly generate even more gold, but that's for the player to decide if the short-term benefit is worth it.

Starting with patch 1.1, the [[Bunch of Coins]] can be combined with the [[Holy Armor]] to create the [[Gold Armor]], which has many positive effects, with the drawback of making the player's weapons attack slower. The [[Maneki-neko]] can also be used for this craft, and is probably more straight-forward to obtain, but the [[Bunch of Coins]] is the more economical route, as the required [[Piggybank]] costs only 3 {{icon/gold}} while the [[Maneki-neko]] costs 10 {{icon/gold}}. This would require the [[Hammer]] of course, which costs 8 {{icon/gold}}, but could be used or sold.
